        "text": "<thinking> To create the file write_correlated_logs.py, I need to use the AWS CloudWatch Logs service to write application log events that include a shared request or correlation identifier. I will import the necessary AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) and use the put_log_events method to send log events to a specific log stream. The code will include the AWS service-specific client class and method, making the provider identifiable. </thinking>\n",
